    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Myth Tamer is a strategy simulation game about controlling mythical beasts and using magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will play the role of a magician, sign a contract with the mythical beast, and use the magic of the mythical beast in the form of cards in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840160/extras/00dfcaf21da28f86977565bcbb2a2a4c.poster.avif?t=1752020593\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840160/extras/00dfcaf21da28f86977565bcbb2a2a4c.webm?t=1752020593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840160/extras/00dfcaf21da28f86977565bcbb2a2a4c.mp4?t=1752020593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and unique magical power mechanism</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each beast will have its own unique skill set and unique upgrade effect. The comprehensive evolution from numerical value to mechanism will bring rich possibilities to the battle combination</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the magical power is upgraded to the maximum level, you can also unlock the magic battle to obtain the magic skill. The magic skill is a powerful effect unlocked during the battle, from active to passive, and has a unique meaning in the battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840160/extras/47435ab09cdca555941d2ec897ad42c6.poster.avif?t=1752020593\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840160/extras/47435ab09cdca555941d2ec897ad42c6.webm?t=1752020593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840160/extras/47435ab09cdca555941d2ec897ad42c6.mp4?t=1752020593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter-based growth system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the main storyline progresses, players will gain more levels of numerical improvement, passive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each battle will expand the rich content mechanism, bringing a game experience worth savoring to strategy players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
